config BR2_PACKAGE_MALI_KBASE
	bool "mali-kbase"
	depends on BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
	help
	  ARM Mali Midgard/Bifrost kbase kernel driver, built out of tree
	  against this board's kernel.

	  The userspace side is a separate package (mali-libs); this is only
	  the kernel module the blob talks to.

	  https://github.com/beebono/mali_kbase

comment "mali-kbase needs a Linux kernel to be built"
	depends on !BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
